      "cooked": "<p>I just experienced something that I think might be a bug, but I'm not totally sure, so I thought I'd share it and ask for comment before filing a report...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Nightmist had Amulet of the Elder Gods in play and her only card was Enlightenment.&nbsp; On her turn, she played Enlightenment, which revealed a 4.&nbsp; She took the damage and chose to draw 4 cards for herself.&nbsp; She then used Attunement as her Power.&nbsp; The Amulet prompt came up asking if she wished to redirect damage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm thinking that prompt shouldn't have appeared, as this was not the first time she would take damage this turn.&nbsp; It's just the first time she would take damage while she had cards in her hand to discard.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Is there anything else I might be missing, or is my assumption correct?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
